  "releaseNotes": "Resilience pipelines with Retry, Timeout, Circuit Breaker, Dependency Injection, and OpenTelemetry metrics.\n\t\t\t2.0.1: SourceLink + XML documentation now shipped; rename NoOpResiliencePipeline.ExecuteAsync parameter ct to cancellationToken to match IResiliencePipeline; deterministic builds; assembly version normalized.\n\t\t\t2.0.2: Package-only fix. The 2.0.1 nuspec declared CoreSystem.Observability.Abstractions 1.0.0 because the package was tagged before the central pin was refreshed. This release declares 1.0.1. No code or API changes.\n\t\t\t2.0.3: Dependency refresh. Polly 8.7.0 to 8.8.0; OpenTelemetry.Extensions.Hosting 1.19.0 to 1.20.0; CoreSystem.Observability.Abstractions refreshed to 1.0.2 (Microsoft.Extensions.Diagnostics.HealthChecks 8.0.32). No code or API changes.",
